[00:00.00] 作词 : Tebza Majaivane/Yunfan Sun
[00:01.00] 作曲 : Yunfan Sun/David Wen Wei Liang
[00:24.98]Bathi indlela
[00:26.03]Indlela sibuza kuba dala
[00:27.54]Lo yazi ndlela uphethi iskill sa mahala
[00:29.52]Yisthandwa sa bo gogo
[00:30.73]Yisthandwa sa bo mkhulu
[00:31.90]Kodwathina ntwana mas'khula slahli ndlela
[00:33.72]Sphenduke abo lova bese sgijimisi phapha
[00:35.26]We live in the maze, sphuma e Soweto
[00:37.94]Risking everyday, to escape this ghetto
[00:40.02]Ingani e ngakhali, cleva ifele mbelekweni
[00:42.29]Abo cleva base kasi bena feila eskolweni
[00:43.87]No motivation, poor education
[00:46.39]More starvations leading to corruption
[00:48.73]Sfuni mali, sfuni bokuku
[00:50.80]Sfuna woku mhlaba nathi sfane na be lunguuuuugu
[00:57.42]阳光洒在你五点半的脸上
[01:07.95]照亮渔夫王的忧伤
[01:15.99]月影森林的长椅边缘我在
[01:24.93]寻找金羊毛和面霜
[01:31.18]悬置另一只靴子
[01:34.26]我们决定跳舞
[01:36.54]迈开凌波微步
[01:38.60]滑向别的向度
[01:40.77]天真并非麻木
[01:42.93]世故亦非成熟
[01:45.19]没被现实俘虏
[01:47.08]万物皆可救赎
[01:50.29]七颗种子破土而出
[01:57.75]仿佛整个童年般漫长
[02:05.71]一个问题射向远方
[02:14.92]开始勾勒未来的模样
[02:24.58]看思绪飘来飘去
[02:28.39]温柔宇宙
[02:32.82]听潮水此起彼伏
[02:37.07]时间的漩涡
[02:40.88]Bathi indlela
[02:41.77]Indlela sibuza kuba dala
[02:43.35]Lo yazi ndlela uphethi iskill sa mahala
[02:45.35]Yisthandwa sa bo gogo
[02:46.63]Yisthandwa sa bo mkhulu
[02:47.70]Kodwathina ntwana mas'khula slahli ndlela
[02:49.58]Sphenduke abo lova bese sgijimisi phapha
[02:51.66]We live in the maze, sphuma e Soweto
[02:53.71]Risking everyday, to escape this ghetto
[02:55.84]Ingani e ngakhali, cleva ifele mbelekweni
[02:57.92]Abo cleva base kasi bena feila eskolweni
[02:59.93]No motivation, poor education
[03:02.37]More starvations leading to corruption
[03:04.58]Sfuni mali, sfuni bokuku
[03:06.69]Sfuna woku mhlaba nathi sfane na be lunguuuuugu
[03:14.53]几朵停云
[03:19.34]从没说过再见
[03:23.62]有一天就离开这世间
[03:31.36]另一些半句多
[03:36.05]明明近在眼前
[03:40.59]却陌生得像远在天边
[03:48.70]没有谎言需要掩盖
[03:57.67]没有真相需要坦白
[04:06.31]不算太迟随时展开
[04:14.51]不算太早就是现在
